   "title": "Wikivoyage: Goa",
   "summary": "With better connectivity by air and rail, there has been an influx of people from neighbouring states that has brought with it different cultures. Many old Goan ancestral properties therefore lie either abandoned or mired in legal tangles brought about by disagreements within the widely dispersed inheritors of the property. It is advised to make bookings for trains, buses and flights well in advan",
